{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapviewdelegate\/mapview:viewforannotation:"]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a view object to mark the given point annotation object on the map."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"text":"- (","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotationView","text":"MLNAnnotationView","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)MLNAnnotationView","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mapView:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"MLNMapView","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)MLNMapView"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"mapView"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"viewForAnnotation:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:Qoobjc(pl)MLNAnnotation","text":"id<MLNAnnotation>"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"annotation"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The map view that requested the annotation view.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"mapView"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The object representing the annotation that is about to be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"displayed.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"annotation"}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The view object to display for the given annotation or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" if you"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"want to display an annotation image instead."}]}],"kind":"content"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/AnnotationViewExample"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Implement this method to mark a point annotation with a view object. If you"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"want to mark a particular point annotation with a static image instead, omit"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this method or have it return "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" for that annotation, then implement"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-mapView:imageForAnnotation:"},{"type":"text","text":" instead."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Annotation views are compatible with UIKit, Core Animation, and other Cocoa"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Touch frameworks. On the other hand, static annotation images use less memory"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and draw more quickly than annotation views."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The user location annotation view can also be customized via this method. When"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"annotation"},{"type":"text","text":" is an instance of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNUserLocation","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" (or equal to the map view’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"userLocation"},{"type":"text","text":" property), return an instance of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNUserLocationAnnotationView","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(or a subclass thereof)."}]